<title>USA: Holly says stock delisted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Holly says stock delisted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>BALA CYNWYD, Pa. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holly Holdings Inc said Thursday its common stock has been delisted from the Nasdaq SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>The company said it is requesting that its market-makers file packages with the National Association of Securities Dealers (NASD) immediately in order for the common stock to resume trading on the OTC Bulletin Board.</p>
<p>The company said it is hopeful its common stock will resume trading on the OTC Bulletin Board sometime next week.</p>
</text>
